season.late_autumn.name
* Late autumn

season.late_autumn.toast
* Wet leaves on the doorstep. Autumn has settled in.

season.frost.name
* Frost

season.frost.toast
* Frost in the window corners this morning.

season.advent.name
* Advent

season.advent.toast
* Advent. Grandma would be getting out the box by now.

season.first_snow.name
* First snow

season.first_snow.toast
* Snow on the roofs of Holešovice.

season.spring.name
* Spring

season.spring.toast
* Spring rain, and petals stuck to the window.

season.summer.name
* Summer

season.summer.toast
* Warm nights. The windows stay open.

