# --- decor themes (§11.2) ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
theme.grandma_original.name
* Grandma's original

theme.grandma_original.desc
* Faded rose-stripe wallpaper, honey-coloured wood, lace and amber lamps. Exactly as Lida left it.

theme.grandma_original.missed
* Lida's wallpaper… you changed it. Well. It's your café now.

theme.art_nouveau.name
* Prague Art Nouveau

theme.art_nouveau.desc
* A sage-and-gold mosaic band, brass lamps and curved trims, like an old Secession café.

theme.station_retro.name
* Station Retro

theme.station_retro.desc
* Cream and bottle-green paint, enamel signs and a timetable board — the 1979 railway buffet.

theme.nocturne_2039.name
* Nocturne 2039

theme.nocturne_2039.desc
* Indigo holo accents, warm LED strips and a touch of Shiftella violet.

theme.winter_lights.name
* Winter Lights

theme.winter_lights.desc
* White-gold fairy lights, red ribbons and spruce. Cosiest in Advent.

# --- reward decor and theme accents ---------------------------------------------------------------------
furniture.fairy_lights.name
* Fairy lights

furniture.fairy_lights.desc
* A string of tiny warm lights. Paid for by a jar of tips.

furniture.lace_tablecloth.name
* Table with grandma's lace

furniture.lace_tablecloth.desc
* A small table under one of Lida's lace tablecloths.

furniture.record_shelf.name
* Record shelf

furniture.record_shelf.desc
* A shelf for sleeves and stories. Music lovers linger by it.

furniture.cat_bed.name
* Cat bed

furniture.cat_bed.desc
* A round cushion by the radiator. Someone will claim it.

furniture.brass_bell.name
* Brass espresso bell

furniture.brass_bell.desc
* Ding. The sound of a coffee being ready, since 1979.

furniture.napkin_wall.name
* Napkin wall

furniture.napkin_wall.desc
* Thank-you napkins pinned in a frame. Every one a small night.

furniture.lamp_brass.name
* Brass pendant lamp

furniture.lamp_brass.desc
* Curved brass and warm glass, in the Art Nouveau style.

furniture.mosaic_rug.name
* Mosaic rug

furniture.mosaic_rug.desc
* A rug with a sage-and-gold Secession pattern.

furniture.enamel_sign.name
* Enamel station sign

furniture.enamel_sign.desc
* "Bufet" in white on bottle green. Rescued from an old platform.

furniture.led_strip.name
* LED strip lamp

furniture.led_strip.desc
* A slim column of warm indigo light.

# --- the station cat (§6.2) -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
cat.level.0
* A stranger at the door

cat.level.2
* The cat sits on the doormat now.

cat.level.3
* The cat watches the milk jug. Maybe a cat face in the foam?

cat.level.4
* The cat came inside and fell asleep under the radiator.

cat.level.6
* The cat has its own spot on the window seat.

cat.level.8
* The cat follows you around. It works here now.

cat.level.10
* The cat is family.

cat.level_up
* The station cat: {level}

cat.name.vlak
* Vlak

cat.name.kofi
* Kofi

cat.name.lidka
* Lidka

